ine behavior failures and missing new API errors, separately preserved.','SDK first-green attempt retained old fixture callsite stem; actual1 preserved then corrected.','work_packages final whole24 actual0 but outer source guard1 due serialized index statcache;33source/HEAD unchanged; separate fresh24+54 actual0 authoritative.','ARM r1 actual1/0commands inherited GIT_PAGER; r2 actual1/0commands unregistered recursive dependencies; Root metadata preparation failures preserved in its own receipts; final r3 only removes asserted known pager and sees15exact dependencies.','Style first guard before child failed900MiB spawn condition; later style30 actual1 because4new paths are not staged. Content checks use maintained public APIs without staging; Root full hook remains mandatory.'],'budget_history':{'original_aggregate_cap':6291456,'observed_main_prefix':5582848,'observed_docs_prefix':843776,'observed_aggregate':6426624,'excess':135168,'classification':'Original per-run helper checked only main prefix and omitted docs; not retroactively declared complete6MiB admission. Stopped new sealing, Parent explicitly authorized8MiB preserving all originals.','current_aggregate_cap':8388608,'native_cap':201326592,'native_actual_allocated':158699520,'arm_cap':268435456,'arm_final_actual_allocated':5345280,'docs_output_cap':67108864,'docs_output_actual_allocated':24256512},'baseline_comparisons':comparisons,'physical_status':'not_executed','qualification':False}
